{"name":"Teeny Bikini","hex":"#326395","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"teeny","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Very small; tiny."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A teenager; a teenybopper."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/teeny"},{"term":"bikini","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A brief, often minimalistic two-piece bathing suit worn by women, especially one that exposes the midriff and navel.","A brief bathing suit covering only the pelvis (equivalent to the bottom portion of a two-piece bikini), worn by any gender."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bikini"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bikini","blocks":[{"text":"A bikini is a women's two-piece swimsuit featuring a top piece covering the breasts, and a bottom piece covering the pelvis and some or all of the buttocks. The extent covered by both pieces can vary, from those that offer full coverage of the breasts, pelvis, and buttocks, to more revealing designs with thong or G-string bottoms that cover only the mons pubis and intergluteal cleft, and tops that cover only the areolae. Bikini bottoms covering about half of the buttocks may be described as \"Brazilian-cut\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Three_Girls_Surfers_Paradise_in_bikinis.jpg/330px-Three_Girls_Surfers_Paradise_in_bikinis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bikini","wikidata":"Q14090"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Able_crossroads.jpg/500px-Able_crossroads.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Able_crossroads.jpg/1280px-Able_crossroads.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Able_crossroads.jpg/500px-Able_crossroads.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Operation Crossroads was a nuclear test series at the Bikini Atoll, and the inspiration for the naming of two French swimsuit designs at the time, including the bikini.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAble_crossroads.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Villa_Romana_del_Casale_BW_2025-04-28_11-11-12.jpg/500px-Villa_Romana_del_Casale_BW_2025-04-28_11-11-12.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Villa_Romana_del_Casale_BW_2025-04-28_11-11-12.jpg/1280px-Villa_Romana_del_Casale_BW_2025-04-28_11-11-12.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Villa_Romana_del_Casale_BW_2025-04-28_11-11-12.jpg/500px-Villa_Romana_del_Casale_BW_2025-04-28_11-11-12.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The ancient Roman Villa Romana del Casale (286–305 CE) in Sicily has one of the earliest known bikini-type images.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVilla_Romana_del_Casale_BW_2025-04-28_11-11-12.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Bathing_Beauties_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Bathing_Beauties_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Bathing_Beauties_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Bathing_Beauties_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABathing_Beauties_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/AKellermanUnitard1909.JPG/500px-AKellermanUnitard1909.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"h